          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Nathan Hughes earns Test return in Jake White's Fiji squad",
          "body": "Former England international Nathan Hughes returns to Test rugby this month after being drafted into Jake White's 35-man Fiji group. The Racing 92 forward won 22 caps for England between 2016 and 2019, and is one of four uncapped players in the squad, alongside Peniami Narisia, Marika Parker and Setareki Bituniyata. Fiji meet France, Ireland and Italy as they try to climb off the bottom of the Southern Hemisphere pool, having beaten Japan 34-28 last weekend."
