          "heading": "Oghre and Blamire make England hooker case in Premiership round five",
          "body": "Planet Rugby's winners-and-losers verdict on Friday's Gallagher Premiership round-five match between Bristol Bears and Leicester Tigers says hookers Gabe Oghre and Jamie Blamire gave England a timely reminder of their claims. Both contributed superbly in the set-piece, and Blamire scored in Leicester's 22-16 win. The writer believes both nailed their final audition for the training squad next week, and reckons Borthwick would have liked what he saw."
