          "heading": "Jeremy Ward's reported France call-up remains unconfirmed as squad decision stays open",
          "body": "Jeremy Ward's possible France call-up is still open. SA Rugby Magazine reported on 22 October that France were set to call up the South African centre. No confirmation has appeared in today's coverage. The item stays open until France confirm their finalised squad for the Nations Championship. Nothing in today's coverage adds to, or contradicts, that original account."
