          "kicker": "Player interview",
          "heading": "Finn Russell opens up on Henry Pollock and Scotland's All Blacks bid",
          "body": "In a Daily Mail interview, Finn Russell covers sharing the spotlight with Henry Pollock and Scotland's bid to make history against the All Blacks. The history is a steep one: New Zealand have won 31 of 33 previous meetings, with draws in 1964 and 1983, and Scotland have never won. Saturday's Round 4 test at Murrayfield is the next chance to change that."
