          "kicker": "Disciplinary case",
          "heading": "Ebbw Vale's Curtis Gregory misses Cardiff clash while appealing red-card stamp ban",
          "body": "Ebbw Vale second-row Curtis Gregory will not play while he appeals a ban after being sent off for stamping on the leg of Llandovery captain Joe Powell in last week's Super Rygbi Cymru match. Referee Craig Evans stopped play in the 35th minute and told the crowd: \"Red card. Permanent.\" The Welsh Rugby Union had not announced a ban when Ebbw Vale named their team, and its length is still unclear. The Cardiff match he missed on Saturday was set to count towards whatever ban follows."
