          "kicker": "Squad return",
          "heading": "Facundo Isa returns to Los Pumas squad for Ireland, replacing injured Grondona",
          "body": "Facundo Isa is back in Felipe Contepomi's 33-man squad for the opening November test against Ireland, called up in place of the injured Santiago Grondona. Isa missed out on international duty in both 2024 and 2026 and has not played for Argentina since July 2025. Thomas Gallo, Santiago Carreras and Joaquín Oviedo are among those ruled out with long-term injuries, and Isa's return comes against a backdrop of absence."
        },
