          "body": "Japan's record in the table is 10th of 12 after three games: one win, two defeats, 62 points scored and 88 conceded, a difference of -26. The most recent of those defeats was 28-34 to Fiji. Next up is Wales in Round 4 of the Nations Championship, where Japan will be looking to turn those figures around."
