    "467": {
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "edition": "Sunday 1 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad rotation",
          "heading": "Hansen says Erasmus is resting Etzebeth for the World Cup",
          "body": "Former All Blacks coach Steve Hansen thinks Rassie Erasmus is looking after senior players for the World Cup, and points to Eben Etzebeth. \"There's no doubt about that with Etzebeth,\" Hansen said on the Rugby Unity podcast. Etzebeth, Cheslin Kolbe, Andre Esterhuizen and Handré Pollard were omitted through injury, and six uncapped players were included in the touring squad. Hansen does see a gamble, saying Erasmus is \"rolling the dice in some areas\", but expects him to pick the strongest group when it matters."
